#NEXUS

[ rauhut2012a_fig4: Theropod tree, 28 tips, with two polytomies: a five-way node (Afrovenator + Dubreuillosaurus + (Torvosaurus, Megalosaurus) as one three-way node, then Duriavenator, Magnosaurus, Streptospondylus, Eustreptospondylus) inside Megalosauroidea. Node circles sit on the stems and are not tips. Random-sample case (seed 20261106). Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=28;
    TAXLABELS
        Syntarsus_kayentakatae
        Dilophosaurus
        Abelisauridae
        Ceratosaurus
        Chuandongcoelurus
        Afrovenator
        Dubreuillosaurus
        Torvosaurus
        Megalosaurus
        Duriavenator
        Magnosaurus
        Streptospondylus
        Eustreptospondylus
        Sciurumimus
        Baryonichinae
        Spinosaurinae
        Monolophosaurus
        Xuanhanosaurus
        Marshosaurus
        Piatnitzkysaurus
        Condorraptor
        Sinraptoridae
        Allosaurus
        Carcharodontosauridae
        Neovenatoridae
        Compsognathus
        Tanycolagreus
        Guanlong
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE rauhut2012a_fig4 = [&R] (Syntarsus_kayentakatae,(Dilophosaurus,((Abelisauridae,Ceratosaurus),(Chuandongcoelurus,((((((((Afrovenator,Dubreuillosaurus,(Torvosaurus,Megalosaurus)),Duriavenator,Magnosaurus,Streptospondylus,Eustreptospondylus),Sciurumimus),(Baryonichinae,Spinosaurinae)),Monolophosaurus),(Xuanhanosaurus,(Marshosaurus,(Piatnitzkysaurus,Condorraptor)))),(Sinraptoridae,(Allosaurus,(Carcharodontosauridae,Neovenatoridae)))),(Compsognathus,(Tanycolagreus,Guanlong)))))));
END;
